# §NO-SCRAPED-VENDOR-BUNDLES — probe intermediates, not artefacts.
# rpuc_main.js (2.36 MB) carried a live Mapbox Secret Access Token belonging to
# the RPUC portal and was blocked by GitHub Push Protection. A scraped bundle is
# a means of finding an endpoint, never evidence worth keeping: the endpoint it
# yielded is recorded in probe-a.log.md, which is the durable artefact.
*.scraped.js
rpuc_main.js
*_main.js
